    "detailed_description": "The game itself is a very simple mechanism.<br />\r\nDuring the day, you gather resources, and at night, you connect your life with the flame.<br />\r\nIf the flame goes out at night or if the fire is not lit by night, that's the end of the game.<br />\r\nYou can use the points you earn to upgrade your equipment to make it more survivable, and then try again.<br />\r\nYou can try to see how many days you can survive.<br />\r\nOr just stare into the flames.<br />\r\nIt is important to take time to quiet your mind and forget the fatigue of daily life.<br />\r\nThis game provides players with such time.",
    "about_the_game": "The game itself is a very simple mechanism.<br />\r\nDuring the day, you gather resources, and at night, you connect your life with the flame.<br />\r\nIf the flame goes out at night or if the fire is not lit by night, that's the end of the game.<br />\r\nYou can use the points you earn to upgrade your equipment to make it more survivable, and then try again.<br />\r\nYou can try to see how many days you can survive.<br />\r\nOr just stare into the flames.<br />\r\nIt is important to take time to quiet your mind and forget the fatigue of daily life.<br />\r\nThis game provides players with such time.",
    "short_description": "Forgetting the busyness and coldness of daily life, we sometimes gaze at the flames and then at ourselves. It would be nice to have such a time.",
